    {
      "text": "gathering together of the waters called he Seas, Gen. 1:10 (Moses 2:10). Lord caused the sea to go back … and made the sea dry land, Ex. 14:21 (Ps. 66:6). south border shall be … salt sea eastward, Num. 34:3. he made a molten sea, 1 Kgs. 7:23 (2 Chr. 4:2). took down the sea from off the brasen oxen, 2 Kgs. 16:17 (2 Chr. 4:10). brasen sea that was in the house of the Lord, 2 Kgs. 25:13 (Jer. 52:17, 20). dominion also from sea to sea, Ps. 72:8 (Zech. 9:10). He rebuked the Red sea, Ps. 106:9. sea saw it, and fled, Ps. 114:3. earth shall be full of the knowledge of the Lord, as the waters cover the sea, Isa. 11:9 (Hab. 2:14; 2 Ne. 21:9). wicked are like the troubled sea, Isa. 57:20. brought them up out of the sea, Isa. 63:11. four great beasts came up from the sea, Dan. 7:3. Jonah, and cast him forth into the sea, Jonah 1:15.",
